<!--
  Tomcat context for NYEHMS (replaces the WebLogic data sources and weblogic.xml).

  The ${...} values are read from system properties, e.g. $CATALINA_BASE/conf/catalina.properties:
      nyehms.db.app.url=jdbc:oracle:thin:@//host:1521/SERVICE
      nyehms.db.app.user=...
      nyehms.db.app.password=...
      (same for nyehms.db.urs.* and nyehms.db.ehars.*)
  Keep credentials out of this file. The Oracle driver (ojdbc11.jar) must be in $CATALINA_HOME/lib.

  The context path is taken from the WAR name, not from this file:
  deploy as  doh2#applinks#nyehms.war  to keep the old context root /doh2/applinks/nyehms.
-->
